                [
                    116.0,
                    950.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ If we revise the program, we can serve clients more efficiently.",
            "block_bbox": [
                101,
                964,
                612,
                988
            ],
            "block_id": 19,
            "block_order": 18,
            "group_id": 19,
            "global_block_id": 19,
            "global_group_id": 19,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    101.0,
                    964.0
                ],
                [
                    612.0,
                    964.0
                ],
                [
                    612.0,
                    988.0
                ],
                [
                    101.0,
                    988.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The logic of your sentences is more explicit. When you nominalize verbs, you link actions with fuzzy prepositions and phrases such as of, by, and on the part of. But when you use verbs, you link clauses with precise subordinating conjunctions such as because, although, and if:",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                1008,
                772,
                1111
            ],
            "block_id": 20,
            "block_order": 19,
            "group_id": 20,
            "global_block_id": 20,
            "global_group_id": 20,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    1008.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1008.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1111.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    1111.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Our more effective presentation of our study resulted in our success, despite an earlier start by others.",
            "block_bbox": [
                118,
                1118,
                742,
                1165
            ],
            "block_id": 21,
            "block_order": 20,
            "group_id": 21,
            "global_block_id": 21,
            "global_group_id": 21,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    118.0,
                    1118.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    1118.0
